# A source gate both grade-gated (required L3) and reserved on kind `audit`. Granted L1
# < L3 would yield grade-human at step (4), but kind `audit` matches the reservation, so
# step (3) `reserved` fires first and pre-empts the grade comparison (most-restrictive
# -wins by precedence).
actor bot grade L1
human ombud role ombud
gate  decide  risk low  grade L3  grant bot
reserve audit by ombud
cord  bot    -> decide
cord  decide -> master
